(2585840, 358541, 4210, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. It shows a nice control of dof and colour use. I think the border of this image is tasteful and also very important in creating a "boundary" that ties in with the background.<br/>Although, now that I go to click a score, I might warn you to rethink giving you images a number for a title, because my automatic instinct is to click on 6. Can you make those pencils into an 8 or something?? :)</td>', 'I really like this image. It shows a nice control of dof and colour use. I think the border of this image is tasteful and also very important in creating a "boundary" that ties in with the background.Although, now that I go to click a score, I might warn you to rethink giving you images a number for a title, because my automatic instinct is to click on 6. Can you make those pencils into an 8 or something?? :)', '2006-07-05 01:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
