(2586137, 354935, 12750, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I had this exact idea though I didn''t execute it in my mind as well as you have captured it. Well done! I like the hint of text that is readable, hopefully others can realize that as well.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would change is the lighting on the shell and glass. It does not seem a natural warmth compared to a beach shot lighting. Maybe try filtering the light with cloth/paper over the bulb to disipate it?</td>', 'Nice capture. I had this exact idea though I didn''t execute it in my mind as well as you have captured it. Well done! I like the hint of text that is readable, hopefully others can realize that as well. The only thing I would change is the lighting on the shell and glass. It does not seem a natural warmth compared to a beach shot lighting. Maybe try filtering the light with cloth/paper over the bulb to disipate it?', '2006-07-05 02:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
