(2586647, 358181, 57260, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. As far as your picture is concerned, I would increase the contrast to bring out the shadows, adjust the white balance a bit because it has a slight yellow colour cast at the moment, and sharpen it. When you''ve done these you''ll find the picture would have a more depth to it and not appear quite so flat.</td>', 'Nice idea. As far as your picture is concerned, I would increase the contrast to bring out the shadows, adjust the white balance a bit because it has a slight yellow colour cast at the moment, and sharpen it. When you''ve done these you''ll find the picture would have a more depth to it and not appear quite so flat.', '2006-07-05 06:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
