(2586675, 358527, 36328, '<td valign="top">Shame you didn''t turn the centre green one around so the tape wasn''t showing. Also, greater care with making the tubes would have made this a better shot. Glue instead of tape also. Contrast and comp is good, and it''s a great idea. Shame the overall execution is as good. (5)</td>', 'Shame you didn''t turn the centre green one around so the tape wasn''t showing. Also, greater care with making the tubes would have made this a better shot. Glue instead of tape also. Contrast and comp is good, and it''s a great idea. Shame the overall execution is as good. (5)', '2006-07-05 06:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
