(2587011, 355631, 61138, '<td valign="top">I started out with origami, but I just couldn''t get anything decently folded. This piece is gorgeous. Very clean lines. I wonder about the off-center composition, though. And it might benefit from softer lighting. Some of the highlights seem harsh.<br/> <br/>Overall, quite beautiful.</td>', 'I started out with origami, but I just couldn''t get anything decently folded. This piece is gorgeous. Very clean lines. I wonder about the off-center composition, though. And it might benefit from softer lighting. Some of the highlights seem harsh. Overall, quite beautiful.', '2006-07-05 09:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
