(2587094, 357103, 57229, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice picture of a girl who is about as naked as the rules will allow. The pen and paper, presumably the subject to which the title refers, are mundane in their contribution to the picture. The pose, attitude and dress of the girl doesn''t seem to have a whole lot to do with ''goodbye''. So, one fifth of the picture relates to the title and challenge while the rest is gratuitous nudity. Don''t get me wrong, she''s a lovely model and I''m only too happy to see her posing away in all manner of revealing attitudes. Voting on the picture in this challenge, though, I give you one fifth - 2, sorry.</td>', 'It''s a very nice picture of a girl who is about as naked as the rules will allow. The pen and paper, presumably the subject to which the title refers, are mundane in their contribution to the picture. The pose, attitude and dress of the girl doesn''t seem to have a whole lot to do with ''goodbye''. So, one fifth of the picture relates to the title and challenge while the rest is gratuitous nudity. Don''t get me wrong, she''s a lovely model and I''m only too happy to see her posing away in all manner of revealing attitudes. Voting on the picture in this challenge, though, I give you one fifth - 2, sorry.', '2006-07-05 09:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
