(2589842, 358659, 32293, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2006-07-05 20:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2589889, 358304, 18367, '<td valign="top">All that, then I bet the person tried to jump out of a basement window :O)<br/>Nto only is this a good photo, it has taht one element that is often in too short a supply, that being humour.<br/> <br/>I commend you on a very innovative approach to this challenge, and a well executed image.  GOOD LUCK IN THE CHALLENGE.</td>', 'All that, then I bet the person tried to jump out of a basement window :O)Nto only is this a good photo, it has taht one element that is often in too short a supply, that being humour. I commend you on a very innovative approach to this challenge, and a well executed image.  GOOD LUCK IN THE CHALLENGE.', '2006-07-05 20:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590007, 356687, 51538, '<td valign="top">Clever clever.  Nice work indeed. 9.</td>', 'Clever clever.  Nice work indeed. 9.', '2006-07-05 20:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590009, 358281, 51538, '<td valign="top">Certainly one of my favourites from this challenge. 9.</td>', 'Certainly one of my favourites from this challenge. 9.', '2006-07-05 20:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590011, 357703, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice if a little faux. 8.</td>', 'Nice if a little faux. 8.', '2006-07-05 20:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590013, 358699, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple stock photo-like. 7.</td>', 'Simple stock photo-like. 7.', '2006-07-05 20:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590014, 354970, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice design and colours. 7.</td>', 'Nice design and colours. 7.', '2006-07-05 20:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590018, 357809, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very creative and nicely photographed.  Reminds me of the Chinese and Japanese papercraft. 8.</td>', 'Very creative and nicely photographed.  Reminds me of the Chinese and Japanese papercraft. 8.', '2006-07-05 20:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590020, 358405, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective idea. 7.</td>', 'Simple but effective idea. 7.', '2006-07-05 20:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590022, 357148, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and photographed. 7.</td>', 'Nicely composed and photographed. 7.', '2006-07-05 20:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590028, 357646, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very stock-photo.  Well executed and probably worth all that work! 7.</td>', 'Very stock-photo.  Well executed and probably worth all that work! 7.', '2006-07-05 20:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590041, 354935, 51538, '<td valign="top">If only people could still write cursive copperplate! (rather than reach for the laser printer and computer....).  I like the compositioon, the colours, the message too.  Very well done.  8 for printing (9 if it was written).</td>', 'If only people could still write cursive copperplate! (rather than reach for the laser printer and computer....).  I like the compositioon, the colours, the message too.  Very well done.  8 for printing (9 if it was written).', '2006-07-05 20:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590045, 358311, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice indeed but that quill pen does not look as if it is cut to write. 8.</td>', 'Nice indeed but that quill pen does not look as if it is cut to write. 8.', '2006-07-05 20:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590048, 358452, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot. I like the effect of the narrow depth of field.</td>', 'Nicely composed shot. I like the effect of the narrow depth of field.', '2006-07-05 20:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590054, 358410, 51538, '<td valign="top">I like this understated image.  It sort of - for me - exemplifies the boredom of modern bureaucracy and paperwork (be it on screen or on paper).</td>', 'I like this understated image.  It sort of - for me - exemplifies the boredom of modern bureaucracy and paperwork (be it on screen or on paper).', '2006-07-05 20:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590055, 358403, 61413, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, and beautiful use of colour. Did you experiment with other ways of framing this shot?</td>', 'Clever idea, and beautiful use of colour. Did you experiment with other ways of framing this shot?', '2006-07-05 20:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590056, 355631, 51538, '<td valign="top">Well photographed - but composition could be a little bit more exciting.</td>', 'Well photographed - but composition could be a little bit more exciting.', '2006-07-05 20:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590059, 357630, 51538, '<td valign="top">Clever idea indeed.  It captures the spirit of the title very well.</td>', 'Clever idea indeed.  It captures the spirit of the title very well.', '2006-07-05 20:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590061, 355289, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice alternative entry and well photographed too.</td>', 'Nice alternative entry and well photographed too.', '2006-07-05 20:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590062, 357553, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective. Like the colour.</td>', 'Simple but effective. Like the colour.', '2006-07-05 20:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590064, 358452, 51538, '<td valign="top">Handwritten indeed and much better for being so. 7.</td>', 'Handwritten indeed and much better for being so. 7.', '2006-07-05 20:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590066, 358304, 51538, '<td valign="top">Faux for being printed.  But it is still effective. 7.</td>', 'Faux for being printed.  But it is still effective. 7.', '2006-07-05 20:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590070, 358533, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, with a strong impact. It''s a shame that the left most pencil is clipped off the edge of the shot, though. Did you think of trying for some more dramatic lighting? Maybe have the pencils receding into darkness...</td>', 'Nice idea, with a strong impact. It''s a shame that the left most pencil is clipped off the edge of the shot, though. Did you think of trying for some more dramatic lighting? Maybe have the pencils receding into darkness...', '2006-07-05 20:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590074, 356051, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pencils, arrange in a designer way, add bokeh, and bingo....  Probably not as easy as one might suspect.  A nice, if cliched effect. 7.</td>', 'Pencils, arrange in a designer way, add bokeh, and bingo....  Probably not as easy as one might suspect.  A nice, if cliched effect. 7.', '2006-07-05 20:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590076, 357703, 61413, '<td valign="top">Nice mooody use of light and dark. Well framed, too; though I would have experimented with having the paper at a bit more of an angle.</td>', 'Nice mooody use of light and dark. Well framed, too; though I would have experimented with having the paper at a bit more of an angle.', '2006-07-05 20:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590078, 357220, 51538, '<td valign="top">Clever play on words there. 7 for ingenuity.</td>', 'Clever play on words there. 7 for ingenuity.', '2006-07-05 20:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590079, 358383, 61413, '<td valign="top">Maybe meant for the "stationary" challenge?</td>', 'Maybe meant for the "stationary" challenge?', '2006-07-05 20:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590086, 358680, 61413, '<td valign="top">I love the motion blur.</td>', 'I love the motion blur.', '2006-07-05 20:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590092, 355831, 27763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Lovely forms, tones, and textures.  Well done, indeed.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Lovely forms, tones, and textures.  Well done, indeed.', '2006-07-05 20:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590100, 356362, 61413, '<td valign="top">An eye-catching shot. There''s a lot of empty space here, but I think it works (now I just need to work out <i>why</i> it works, so that I can start introducing space more effectively into my own shots...)<br/> <br/>Effective use of light, too. Did you have the pen suspended on fishing line?</td>', 'An eye-catching shot. There''s a lot of empty space here, but I think it works (now I just need to work out why it works, so that I can start introducing space more effectively into my own shots...) Effective use of light, too. Did you have the pen suspended on fishing line?', '2006-07-05 20:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590111, 356780, 27763, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept!  Execution could be improved (noisy, flat light, kind of snapshotty), but still this is a cool shot artisticly, IMO.</td>', 'Very cool concept!  Execution could be improved (noisy, flat light, kind of snapshotty), but still this is a cool shot artisticly, IMO.', '2006-07-05 20:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590116, 358119, 27763, '<td valign="top">Funny, lol! Interesting light, too.  And good use of shallow DOF.</td>', 'Funny, lol! Interesting light, too.  And good use of shallow DOF.', '2006-07-05 20:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590126, 357103, 61413, '<td valign="top">Beautifully moody. A whole story in one shot. Terrific.<br/> <br/>Good use of light, dark and silhouette. Focus is spot-on. Demeanour of the woman is perfect. Choice of monochrome is absolutely right. Flawless attention to detail at all levels. An inspiration to us all.<br/> <br/>The only thing that I might have tried differently would have been to have things a little less central along the vertical. Maybe have the letter a little more to the left and the woman a little more to the right - but still making sure that the woman''s reflection in the floor leads the eye to the letter.<br/> <br/>It''s just a shame that the 640x426 res isn''t enough for us to read the letter... :-)</td>', 'Beautifully moody. A whole story in one shot. Terrific. Good use of light, dark and silhouette. Focus is spot-on. Demeanour of the woman is perfect. Choice of monochrome is absolutely right. Flawless attention to detail at all levels. An inspiration to us all. The only thing that I might have tried differently would have been to have things a little less central along the vertical. Maybe have the letter a little more to the left and the woman a little more to the right - but still making sure that the woman''s reflection in the floor leads the eye to the letter. It''s just a shame that the 640x426 res isn''t enough for us to read the letter... :-)', '2006-07-05 20:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590129, 357282, 27763, '<td valign="top">That thing looks awesome!  Great light/tones. I think I would prefer a tighter crop, or a wider crop.  As it is, it just seems a bit awkward.  But that''s totally personal taste.  Looks a bit "processed", but in a good way.  Nice work.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That thing looks awesome!  Great light/tones. I think I would prefer a tighter crop, or a wider crop.  As it is, it just seems a bit awkward.  But that''s totally personal taste.  Looks a bit "processed", but in a good way.  Nice work.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-05 21:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590130, 356085, 61413, '<td valign="top">An appealing shot; but a bit off-topic, methinks...</td>', 'An appealing shot; but a bit off-topic, methinks...', '2006-07-05 21:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
