(2590143, 356650, 27763, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract.  Well done.  I like how the rectangles are pretty orderly towards the bottom, then get more disordered as you go up, until finally there''s just white space at the top.  Nice.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Cool abstract.  Well done.  I like how the rectangles are pretty orderly towards the bottom, then get more disordered as you go up, until finally there''s just white space at the top.  Nice.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-07-05 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590149, 358699, 61413, '<td valign="top">A good idea, well executed. The latticework of the basket is almost overwhelming. Good use of colour, too; with the splash of red at the end of the pencil.</td>', 'A good idea, well executed. The latticework of the basket is almost overwhelming. Good use of colour, too; with the splash of red at the end of the pencil.', '2006-07-05 21:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
