(2590853, 357437, 56826, '<td valign="top">Very nice....great composition and lighting.  10</td>', 'Very nice....great composition and lighting.  10', '2006-07-06 00:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590855, 358073, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Touching and emotional. I hope this shot does very well for you and if he is overseas that he come home safe and soon.</td>', 'Great shot. Touching and emotional. I hope this shot does very well for you and if he is overseas that he come home safe and soon.', '2006-07-06 00:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590861, 357872, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Beautiful detail and creative thinking.</td>', 'Great shot. Beautiful detail and creative thinking.', '2006-07-06 00:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590869, 354935, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the colors and details. Best of the bottle shots.</td>', 'Great shot. Love the colors and details. Best of the bottle shots.', '2006-07-06 00:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590875, 358311, 53147, '<td valign="top">So what does it say? I like this shot. Duotones work well and it just a has an overall good feel to it.</td>', 'So what does it say? I like this shot. Duotones work well and it just a has an overall good feel to it.', '2006-07-06 00:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590876, 357553, 56826, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I like the perspective.  I would have liked it even more without the green.</td>', 'Great idea.  I like the perspective.  I would have liked it even more without the green.', '2006-07-06 00:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590880, 358663, 53147, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Nice muted colors and reflection. I dont much care for the glare on the left corner and the cropping out of the edge of the right croissant. But a good job overall.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Nice muted colors and reflection. I dont much care for the glare on the left corner and the cropping out of the edge of the right croissant. But a good job overall.', '2006-07-06 00:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590889, 358403, 53147, '<td valign="top">Simple, smooth and great colors. Love the negative space and the angle the paper is coming out at. One of my top picks of the challenge. Bumping up.</td>', 'Simple, smooth and great colors. Love the negative space and the angle the paper is coming out at. One of my top picks of the challenge. Bumping up.', '2006-07-06 00:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2590890, 358073, 51424, '<td valign="top">Could you please tell you son THANK YOU! And God Bless.</td>', 'Could you please tell you son THANK YOU! And God Bless.', '2006-07-06 00:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591057, 358642, 61146, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Excellent lighting.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Excellent lighting.', '2006-07-06 00:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591070, 355176, 4210, '<td valign="top">I guess I kinda get the idea you were going for here, but the composition is so cluttered and I can''t really make out what anything is.</td>', 'I guess I kinda get the idea you were going for here, but the composition is so cluttered and I can''t really make out what anything is.', '2006-07-06 01:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591076, 358341, 4210, '<td valign="top">I really like the post-it note with the question mark, but I''m not too sure about the pen (which kinda seems to be floating in black) and I definately am not a fan of the woodgrain as the background.</td>', 'I really like the post-it note with the question mark, but I''m not too sure about the pen (which kinda seems to be floating in black) and I definately am not a fan of the woodgrain as the background.', '2006-07-06 01:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591087, 357549, 36043, '<td valign="top">I think some actual caligraphy would have added alot here</td>', 'I think some actual caligraphy would have added alot here', '2006-07-06 01:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591098, 358497, 4210, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but the focus could be tighter. And if we could get even closer to the pencil tips, that would be even cooler.<br/>I would be careful about using the pencil with the arrows though. The arrows lead the eye away from the main subject and off the image completely. Not exactly what you were going for I presume.<br/>Nice background though. You did get some interesting colour there.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but the focus could be tighter. And if we could get even closer to the pencil tips, that would be even cooler.I would be careful about using the pencil with the arrows though. The arrows lead the eye away from the main subject and off the image completely. Not exactly what you were going for I presume.Nice background though. You did get some interesting colour there.', '2006-07-06 01:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591105, 357646, 4210, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The lighting, the gradient, the hand, everything. Marvelous.</td>', 'I really like this. The lighting, the gradient, the hand, everything. Marvelous.', '2006-07-06 01:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591117, 358607, 4210, '<td valign="top">You managed a really good exposure on the sky. Great contrasting colours. My only qualm is the little black knotted thing. It destracts the eye away from the main subject, although I''m not sure how this image would work without it since it almost seems to keep the eye from sliding off the image when following the lines.</td>', 'You managed a really good exposure on the sky. Great contrasting colours. My only qualm is the little black knotted thing. It destracts the eye away from the main subject, although I''m not sure how this image would work without it since it almost seems to keep the eye from sliding off the image when following the lines.', '2006-07-06 01:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591121, 355714, 4210, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours and lighting here.</td>', 'Very nice colours and lighting here.', '2006-07-06 01:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591123, 358083, 36043, '<td valign="top">Seems like you need the foreground more in focus, maybe more than the background but at least equal in this composition.</td>', 'Seems like you need the foreground more in focus, maybe more than the background but at least equal in this composition.', '2006-07-06 01:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591134, 356687, 4210, '<td valign="top">Very very clever.</td>', 'Very very clever.', '2006-07-06 01:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2591139, 355864, 4210, '<td valign="top">Masterful use of dof to produce the desired image.</td>', 'Masterful use of dof to produce the desired image.', '2006-07-06 01:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
