(2591237, 357103, 36043, '<td valign="top">Outstanding.  Love the choice of DOF, model, lighting everything.  Perhaps a slightly more diagonal composition (letter to the left, model to upper right).  But great anyway.</td>', 'Outstanding.  Love the choice of DOF, model, lighting everything.  Perhaps a slightly more diagonal composition (letter to the left, model to upper right).  But great anyway.', '2006-07-06 01:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
