(2591371, 355388, 41574, '<td valign="top">I love the textures here; good work. One criticism: I would have tried to get the pencil (i.e., near the tip) sharper.</td>', 'I love the textures here; good work. One criticism: I would have tried to get the pencil (i.e., near the tip) sharper.', '2006-07-06 01:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
