(2591387, 357872, 41574, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but, in this otherwise great shot, I just can''t make out the stationery well enough to credit the picture as meeting the challenge.</td>', 'I''m sorry but, in this otherwise great shot, I just can''t make out the stationery well enough to credit the picture as meeting the challenge.', '2006-07-06 01:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
