(2591855, 358497, 53316, '<td valign="top">Gosh. There''s just something about this that draws me in. I love the colors and the shapes, but there''s something extra that I can''t put my finger on that made me gasp when I saw this.</td>', 'Gosh. There''s just something about this that draws me in. I love the colors and the shapes, but there''s something extra that I can''t put my finger on that made me gasp when I saw this.', '2006-07-06 03:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
