(2592458, 356362, 28710, '<td valign="top">This looks rally well set up, and quite well lit. There''s a bit of blooming on the end of the pen that makes me a bit uncomfortable, and a weird red streak about half way up that is quite hard to see...<br/> <br/>You also seem to have encountered a bit of problems with the ''jaggies''.<br/> <br/>Doing multiple resizes might help prevent this... I do mine in 5% increments via an action if it''s not been cropped, but if the ratio is a bit different, I double check the last few steps by hand...<br/> <br/>Great rhythm and interesting composition too.</td>', 'This looks rally well set up, and quite well lit. There''s a bit of blooming on the end of the pen that makes me a bit uncomfortable, and a weird red streak about half way up that is quite hard to see... You also seem to have encountered a bit of problems with the ''jaggies''. Doing multiple resizes might help prevent this... I do mine in 5% increments via an action if it''s not been cropped, but if the ratio is a bit different, I double check the last few steps by hand... Great rhythm and interesting composition too.', '2006-07-06 08:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2592460, 356650, 54228, '<td valign="top">Until I saw the image title I was a little confused as to what I was looking at, wonderful composition and DOF</td>', 'Until I saw the image title I was a little confused as to what I was looking at, wonderful composition and DOF', '2006-07-06 08:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
