(2593529, 357103, 40762, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, how ever..there''s something missing. I dont know what i would do differently, it just needs that "wow".</td>', 'Nice idea, how ever..there''s something missing. I dont know what i would do differently, it just needs that "wow".', '2006-07-06 14:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2593577, 355931, 59343, '<td valign="top">although i''m thankful for the change from paper to look at--i spent way too much time trying to understand the title (that won''t affect your score from me).  this is an otherwise generally interesting picture.  It seems a bit soft, and the numbers on the paper lack resolution with a slight tilt to the right.  The colors are a bit flat as well.  I do like the creativity.</td>', 'although i''m thankful for the change from paper to look at--i spent way too much time trying to understand the title (that won''t affect your score from me).  this is an otherwise generally interesting picture.  It seems a bit soft, and the numbers on the paper lack resolution with a slight tilt to the right.  The colors are a bit flat as well.  I do like the creativity.', '2006-07-06 14:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2593583, 358359, 59343, '<td valign="top">nice attempt at being colorful.  I feel like the trash can disrupts the color though and with the fine pattern is a bit distracting.  It''s otherwise creative and has a good composition</td>', 'nice attempt at being colorful.  I feel like the trash can disrupts the color though and with the fine pattern is a bit distracting.  It''s otherwise creative and has a good composition', '2006-07-06 14:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2593590, 356085, 59343, '<td valign="top">hmm...interesting idea.  I think there is too much focus on the jewelry and not enough on the stationery.  Also the jewelry is lacking good focus--since it''s such a large part of the picture I think it should be a bit sharper so it doesn''t distract as much.</td>', 'hmm...interesting idea.  I think there is too much focus on the jewelry and not enough on the stationery.  Also the jewelry is lacking good focus--since it''s such a large part of the picture I think it should be a bit sharper so it doesn''t distract as much.', '2006-07-06 14:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2593593, 358639, 59343, '<td valign="top">I like the idea in this photo.  I think the pen should be sharper, and the paper should be aligned better.  The pen to me is a major element of the photo--but it''s a bit frustrating to have it so out of focus in the shot.</td>', 'I like the idea in this photo.  I think the pen should be sharper, and the paper should be aligned better.  The pen to me is a major element of the photo--but it''s a bit frustrating to have it so out of focus in the shot.', '2006-07-06 14:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2593597, 357282, 59343, '<td valign="top">This is paper?  It has such a unique look.  I''m curious to know how you did this.  Very interesting texture and compoosition.</td>', 'This is paper?  It has such a unique look.  I''m curious to know how you did this.  Very interesting texture and compoosition.', '2006-07-06 14:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2593602, 356137, 59343, '<td valign="top">nice job at creativity.  the laser pen creates a nice line for the eye to follow--initially I thought i was looking at metal stairs.  nice job at presenting a unique look at the subject.</td>', 'nice job at creativity.  the laser pen creates a nice line for the eye to follow--initially I thought i was looking at metal stairs.  nice job at presenting a unique look at the subject.', '2006-07-06 14:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
