(2595765, 356362, 45475, '<td valign="top">Love this idea and composition. I''ve got the same edge jaggies on mine, but what can you do? Have no idea what causes it as I don''t particularly over-sharpen my images and I suspect (judging by the quality of work), neither do you. Still, my vote is 9 :)</td>', 'Love this idea and composition. I''ve got the same edge jaggies on mine, but what can you do? Have no idea what causes it as I don''t particularly over-sharpen my images and I suspect (judging by the quality of work), neither do you. Still, my vote is 9 :)', '2006-07-07 01:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595909, 357646, 40019, '<td valign="top">Outstanding idea!  Very cool and very well executed - I love the lighting!  Looks like a lot of prep work as well.  Great shot! &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Outstanding idea!  Very cool and very well executed - I love the lighting!  Looks like a lot of prep work as well.  Great shot! <10>', '2006-07-07 02:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595912, 358562, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  This shot would have been helped with a little more color saturation and more dramatic lighting to cast some shadows or create some other more alluring effects.  It''s good, but the lighting is a little bland. Good luck! &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Very nice picture.  This shot would have been helped with a little more color saturation and more dramatic lighting to cast some shadows or create some other more alluring effects.  It''s good, but the lighting is a little bland. Good luck! <6>', '2006-07-07 02:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595918, 358607, 40019, '<td valign="top">Ha, great idea!</td>', 'Ha, great idea!', '2006-07-07 02:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595920, 358314, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Should make the front page!  Good use of colors and form.</td>', 'Great shot!  Should make the front page!  Good use of colors and form.', '2006-07-07 03:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595925, 358527, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but I would have moved the tape on the green center ring to the back - I''m sure I''m not the first to mention that. :-)</td>', 'Great idea, but I would have moved the tape on the green center ring to the back - I''m sure I''m not the first to mention that. :-)', '2006-07-07 03:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595926, 354970, 40019, '<td valign="top">Superb idea and flawless execution.  Should be on the front page - nicely done!</td>', 'Superb idea and flawless execution.  Should be on the front page - nicely done!', '2006-07-07 03:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595967, 355999, 54540, '<td valign="top">You made me laugh!  Creative!</td>', 'You made me laugh!  Creative!', '2006-07-07 03:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595983, 356687, 54540, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea!  Marking as a favorite - I''m curious how you produced the effect!  Well done.</td>', 'Brilliant idea!  Marking as a favorite - I''m curious how you produced the effect!  Well done.', '2006-07-07 03:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596044, 358304, 54778, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful image with a message..</td>', 'A very beautiful image with a message..', '2006-07-07 05:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596080, 358397, 37893, '<td valign="top">Sorry but how can this be an image of "stationery"? This clearly does not meet the challenge. (4)</td>', 'Sorry but how can this be an image of "stationery"? This clearly does not meet the challenge. (4)', '2006-07-07 05:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596082, 358304, 61336, '<td valign="top">Like the idea</td>', 'Like the idea', '2006-07-07 05:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596122, 357646, 61336, '<td valign="top">Did you really wrote all those notes??? Amazing!!!</td>', 'Did you really wrote all those notes??? Amazing!!!', '2006-07-07 06:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596129, 358405, 61336, '<td valign="top">Clever idea! It whould be like sunset hour with a monochrome blue/black background.</td>', 'Clever idea! It whould be like sunset hour with a monochrome blue/black background.', '2006-07-07 06:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596133, 356650, 61336, '<td valign="top">Excelent DOF. You can''t tell if this is staples or big, heavy, steel bars.</td>', 'Excelent DOF. You can''t tell if this is staples or big, heavy, steel bars.', '2006-07-07 06:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596145, 358314, 61336, '<td valign="top">Simple composition. Very good view angle. Nice colours and excellent DOF.</td>', 'Simple composition. Very good view angle. Nice colours and excellent DOF.', '2006-07-07 07:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596150, 355831, 61679, '<td valign="top">Very effective lighting and composition.  I''ve added this one to my favorites.</td>', 'Very effective lighting and composition.  I''ve added this one to my favorites.', '2006-07-07 07:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596158, 354970, 55140, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Gets a 9 from me.</td>', 'Nice idea. Gets a 9 from me.', '2006-07-07 07:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596161, 358405, 55140, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. Not too keen on the colours but still a good shot.</td>', 'Very cool idea. Not too keen on the colours but still a good shot.', '2006-07-07 07:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596214, 355999, 60566, '<td valign="top">I like this!</td>', 'I like this!', '2006-07-07 07:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596659, 356137, 61679, '<td valign="top">If you hadn''t put staples in your title, I would have thought this was part of an escalator.  Great lighting and definitely one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'If you hadn''t put staples in your title, I would have thought this was part of an escalator.  Great lighting and definitely one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2006-07-07 10:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596660, 357282, 61679, '<td valign="top">This has a metallic look to it and is very appealling to the eye.  Definitly one of my favorites.</td>', 'This has a metallic look to it and is very appealling to the eye.  Definitly one of my favorites.', '2006-07-07 10:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596662, 357809, 61679, '<td valign="top">High on the wow factor.  Great lighting.  The border is a nice touch.  Definitely in the running for a blue ribbon.</td>', 'High on the wow factor.  Great lighting.  The border is a nice touch.  Definitely in the running for a blue ribbon.', '2006-07-07 10:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596663, 354970, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Well lite, great design, and the frame adds to this image.</td>', 'Nicely done. Well lite, great design, and the frame adds to this image.', '2006-07-07 10:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596664, 356650, 61679, '<td valign="top">Exceptional execution with a very edgy feel.  This could be a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Exceptional execution with a very edgy feel.  This could be a ribbon winner.', '2006-07-07 10:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596666, 356051, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement of the pencils.  Your color choice for the background is not my favorite but I won''t mark down for that.</td>', 'Nice arrangement of the pencils.  Your color choice for the background is not my favorite but I won''t mark down for that.', '2006-07-07 10:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596667, 358403, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice entry.  The lighting is very good and the composition is well done.</td>', 'Nice entry.  The lighting is very good and the composition is well done.', '2006-07-07 10:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596668, 358304, 61679, '<td valign="top">Using paper with different textures and coloration effectively conveys the concept that the writer used up almost all of the paper sources available in his/her attempt to do it right.  The featured note in the front looks like it was written on a paper bag from the store, which emphasizes this concept even more.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Using paper with different textures and coloration effectively conveys the concept that the writer used up almost all of the paper sources available in his/her attempt to do it right.  The featured note in the front looks like it was written on a paper bag from the store, which emphasizes this concept even more.  Nicely done.', '2006-07-07 10:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596671, 358643, 61679, '<td valign="top">This looks like my daughter''s room.  The futility of the discard pile is enhanced by the simple nature of the final product.  Nice job.</td>', 'This looks like my daughter''s room.  The futility of the discard pile is enhanced by the simple nature of the final product.  Nice job.', '2006-07-07 10:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596673, 357870, 61679, '<td valign="top">Love the angles and colors in this image.  The soft focus is very pleasing and works well.  I''m scoring this one pretty high.</td>', 'Love the angles and colors in this image.  The soft focus is very pleasing and works well.  I''m scoring this one pretty high.', '2006-07-07 10:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596675, 355159, 61679, '<td valign="top">Hope this one scores high.   It is extremely well done.</td>', 'Hope this one scores high.   It is extremely well done.', '2006-07-07 10:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596676, 358223, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The tone and softness work well together.  The positioning of the bottom wax seal could be improved.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The tone and softness work well together.  The positioning of the bottom wax seal could be improved.', '2006-07-07 10:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596677, 356362, 61679, '<td valign="top">Great negative space and the blown highlights actually add to the image.  There appear to be some resizing issues, as I see some pixelation.</td>', 'Great negative space and the blown highlights actually add to the image.  There appear to be some resizing issues, as I see some pixelation.', '2006-07-07 10:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596678, 358541, 61679, '<td valign="top">I know this is not as easy to set up as it looks.  The purple pencil at the top is somewhat distracting and really isn''t necessary for this image to be effective.</td>', 'I know this is not as easy to set up as it looks.  The purple pencil at the top is somewhat distracting and really isn''t necessary for this image to be effective.', '2006-07-07 10:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596679, 358699, 61679, '<td valign="top">If this had less yellow in the background from the light, it would have a huge WoW factor.  Still worthy of a good score.</td>', 'If this had less yellow in the background from the light, it would have a huge WoW factor.  Still worthy of a good score.', '2006-07-07 10:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596680, 357553, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and a very interesting image.  I would like to see this with a little higher contrast to help make the whites whiter.</td>', 'Nicely composed and a very interesting image.  I would like to see this with a little higher contrast to help make the whites whiter.', '2006-07-07 10:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596682, 358663, 61679, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and pattern.  The cropping on the right and the glare on the left are the only things keeping this from being in contention.</td>', 'Great lighting and pattern.  The cropping on the right and the glare on the left are the only things keeping this from being in contention.', '2006-07-07 10:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596684, 358696, 61679, '<td valign="top">Great colors and composition.  The shadow on the top post-it is the only short coming in this image.</td>', 'Great colors and composition.  The shadow on the top post-it is the only short coming in this image.', '2006-07-07 10:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596685, 355631, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image is well composed and the lighting is very good.  If you would have used traditional origami paper (colored with a pattern) it might have been a ribbon winner.</td>', 'This image is well composed and the lighting is very good.  If you would have used traditional origami paper (colored with a pattern) it might have been a ribbon winner.', '2006-07-07 10:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596689, 358106, 61679, '<td valign="top">Well done.  The streaking car lights help define the location of this message.</td>', 'Well done.  The streaking car lights help define the location of this message.', '2006-07-07 10:17:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2596691, 355388, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot.  The only improvement I can suggest is that the llittle bit of background you have should be completely black.</td>', 'I like this image a lot.  The only improvement I can suggest is that the llittle bit of background you have should be completely black.', '2006-07-07 10:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596692, 358083, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W conversion and the definitive focal point.</td>', 'I like the B&W conversion and the definitive focal point.', '2006-07-07 10:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596694, 357703, 61679, '<td valign="top">The tip of the pen is tack sharp and well positioned.  The hand appears to have ink on it, which doesn''t translate to the paper itself.  I would expect to see smudging on the paper since he is resting his hand on top of ink that transferred to his hand.</td>', 'The tip of the pen is tack sharp and well positioned.  The hand appears to have ink on it, which doesn''t translate to the paper itself.  I would expect to see smudging on the paper since he is resting his hand on top of ink that transferred to his hand.', '2006-07-07 10:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596696, 357062, 61679, '<td valign="top">Well done.  My only suggestion would be to add a little more light to the object on the right to bring out the details.</td>', 'Well done.  My only suggestion would be to add a little more light to the object on the right to bring out the details.', '2006-07-07 10:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596697, 357437, 61679, '<td valign="top">I can almost see the pages blowing in the wind.  The sunset coming through the pages is very effective and well executed.  The wall or window frame at behind the right side of the diary is distracting and doesn''t help the compostion.</td>', 'I can almost see the pages blowing in the wind.  The sunset coming through the pages is very effective and well executed.  The wall or window frame at behind the right side of the diary is distracting and doesn''t help the compostion.', '2006-07-07 10:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596698, 355573, 61679, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  The saying appears to be a translation into English and could use a little help.  It would  have been nice to see the words hand written to emphasis your point.</td>', 'Very nice image.  The saying appears to be a translation into English and could use a little help.  It would  have been nice to see the words hand written to emphasis your point.', '2006-07-07 10:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596699, 358359, 61679, '<td valign="top">The title is a little weak, as there is no writing visible on the paper.  Nice colors and composition but the background could be a little more uniform in whiteness.  The basic editing restrictions hurt you a little bit here.  Nice job.</td>', 'The title is a little weak, as there is no writing visible on the paper.  Nice colors and composition but the background could be a little more uniform in whiteness.  The basic editing restrictions hurt you a little bit here.  Nice job.', '2006-07-07 10:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596700, 357220, 61679, '<td valign="top">Perfect title and great realization on the applicability to this challenge.  You might want to crop the bottom a bit to remove the black item (I think it is where the windshield washer spray comes out).</td>', 'Perfect title and great realization on the applicability to this challenge.  You might want to crop the bottom a bit to remove the black item (I think it is where the windshield washer spray comes out).', '2006-07-07 10:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596701, 355289, 61679, '<td valign="top">A unique take on the challenge and well executed image.</td>', 'A unique take on the challenge and well executed image.', '2006-07-07 10:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596702, 358647, 61679, '<td valign="top">I''m missing the connection to LINCOLN.  A nice edgy feel to modern stationery.</td>', 'I''m missing the connection to LINCOLN.  A nice edgy feel to modern stationery.', '2006-07-07 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596703, 357646, 61679, '<td valign="top">Well composed.  You left a blank space in the upper left corner.  Still worthy of a high score.</td>', 'Well composed.  You left a blank space in the upper left corner.  Still worthy of a high score.', '2006-07-07 10:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596705, 358119, 61679, '<td valign="top">A pleasant image but a little weak on subject matter for this challenge.</td>', 'A pleasant image but a little weak on subject matter for this challenge.', '2006-07-07 10:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596707, 357519, 61679, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W conversion is very effective and well executed.  I wonder how this would look with a little more noise to similute film grain.</td>', 'The B&W conversion is very effective and well executed.  I wonder how this would look with a little more noise to similute film grain.', '2006-07-07 10:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596708, 358583, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement.  I would like to have seen the colors in the cranes a bit more saturated.</td>', 'Nice arrangement.  I would like to have seen the colors in the cranes a bit more saturated.', '2006-07-07 10:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596709, 357597, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice effect of the lighting through the pen holder.  I would like to see the out of focus portion of the pen holder in a different position, as my eye is drawn to it after reading the message.</td>', 'Nice effect of the lighting through the pen holder.  I would like to see the out of focus portion of the pen holder in a different position, as my eye is drawn to it after reading the message.', '2006-07-07 10:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596710, 355931, 61679, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  The lighting on this photo leaves it a little flat looking.  If you could have moved the markers away from the background some it would produce better defined shadows and help give the photo more depth.  Another method would be to move the light to the right hand side of the pink marker instead of primarily straight on.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  The lighting on this photo leaves it a little flat looking.  If you could have moved the markers away from the background some it would produce better defined shadows and help give the photo more depth.  Another method would be to move the light to the right hand side of the pink marker instead of primarily straight on.', '2006-07-07 10:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596711, 357065, 61679, '<td valign="top">The blues in this image are very pleasing but I would have liked to have seen the paper a little whiter.  Nicely done overall but it doesn''t have that "I wish I had taken that image" appeal to it.</td>', 'The blues in this image are very pleasing but I would have liked to have seen the paper a little whiter.  Nicely done overall but it doesn''t have that "I wish I had taken that image" appeal to it.', '2006-07-07 10:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596712, 358410, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the overall composition of this image.  I''m not quite sure what that is next to the airplane on the left.  An apple stem?  This distracts from the main focus of the composition.</td>', 'I like the overall composition of this image.  I''m not quite sure what that is next to the airplane on the left.  An apple stem?  This distracts from the main focus of the composition.', '2006-07-07 10:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596717, 355864, 61679, '<td valign="top">The word are the primary focus of this compostion and will probably cause several voters to ding you for it.  The image is technically sound and well done.</td>', 'The word are the primary focus of this compostion and will probably cause several voters to ding you for it.  The image is technically sound and well done.', '2006-07-07 10:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596718, 358314, 61679, '<td valign="top">Great angle and lighting.  This would have really popped if shot with a black background.</td>', 'Great angle and lighting.  This would have really popped if shot with a black background.', '2006-07-07 10:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596719, 358642, 61679, '<td valign="top">I assume this is a work in progress, as there is very little color with work done on the back.  I like the lighting and the background but her upper hip breaks the contour of the body.  Perhaps if her legs were straightened some it would help continue the flow.</td>', 'I assume this is a work in progress, as there is very little color with work done on the back.  I like the lighting and the background but her upper hip breaks the contour of the body.  Perhaps if her legs were straightened some it would help continue the flow.', '2006-07-07 10:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596720, 358452, 61679, '<td valign="top">Your use of stationery is secondary in the composition of this image.  This could hurt you in the scoring.  I would have liked to have seen this with a different background color to better emphasis the paper.  Overall, a very well done image.</td>', 'Your use of stationery is secondary in the composition of this image.  This could hurt you in the scoring.  I would have liked to have seen this with a different background color to better emphasis the paper.  Overall, a very well done image.', '2006-07-07 10:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596721, 355759, 61679, '<td valign="top">Interesting rotation of the image.  It could use a little bit more saturation to make the yellow pencil pop more.</td>', 'Interesting rotation of the image.  It could use a little bit more saturation to make the yellow pencil pop more.', '2006-07-07 10:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596722, 358527, 61679, '<td valign="top">Not quite a rainbow, as the colors are random instead of continous.  The green paper in the center should have been rotated so the tape doesn''t become the center point of the image or better yet, so it doesn''t show at all.<br/> <br/>Edit for Typo''s<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-13 13:10:01.</i></td>', 'Not quite a rainbow, as the colors are random instead of continous.  The green paper in the center should have been rotated so the tape doesn''t become the center point of the image or better yet, so it doesn''t show at all. Edit for Typo''s', '2006-07-07 10:21:19.000000', '2006-07-13 14:10:01.000000', 1),
(2596723, 357630, 61679, '<td valign="top">The image definitely communicates the intent of the title.  The doorframe behind the wastebasket is a little distracting and the colors in the background keep drawing my eye away from the wastebasket.  That isn''t entirely bad, as the writer is as important as the failed attempts.</td>', 'The image definitely communicates the intent of the title.  The doorframe behind the wastebasket is a little distracting and the colors in the background keep drawing my eye away from the wastebasket.  That isn''t entirely bad, as the writer is as important as the failed attempts.', '2006-07-07 10:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596725, 358440, 61679, '<td valign="top">Not what I would typically think of as stationery but you do write on it.  I really don''t have any suggestions for improvement excpet for removing the small area at the upper right hand corner which isn''t part of the crossword puzzle and not part of the black background.  Maybe a little more contrast or converting this to B&amp;W would make it pop more.</td>', 'Not what I would typically think of as stationery but you do write on it.  I really don''t have any suggestions for improvement excpet for removing the small area at the upper right hand corner which isn''t part of the crossword puzzle and not part of the black background.  Maybe a little more contrast or converting this to B&W would make it pop more.', '2006-07-07 10:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596726, 358631, 61679, '<td valign="top">A fun image to look at and well thought out.  The lighting is a bit harsh, which causes the paper to look a little washed out.</td>', 'A fun image to look at and well thought out.  The lighting is a bit harsh, which causes the paper to look a little washed out.', '2006-07-07 10:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596729, 358639, 61679, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the tip of the pen in focus with the paper.  The composition is well thought out and overall, this is a very nice image.</td>', 'I would have liked to see the tip of the pen in focus with the paper.  The composition is well thought out and overall, this is a very nice image.', '2006-07-07 10:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596730, 356453, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and cropping.  A little fill light in the top right corner to eliminate the shadow from the rolled paper would have really made this image work.</td>', 'Nice lines and cropping.  A little fill light in the top right corner to eliminate the shadow from the rolled paper would have really made this image work.', '2006-07-07 10:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596732, 355999, 61679, '<td valign="top">Very creative and a lot of effort was put into this shot.  This is very suitable for stock photography.  I think it is cropped a little too tightly, as I would like to see the tips of the pencils on the right side of the image.</td>', 'Very creative and a lot of effort was put into this shot.  This is very suitable for stock photography.  I think it is cropped a little too tightly, as I would like to see the tips of the pencils on the right side of the image.', '2006-07-07 10:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596734, 354970, 33982, '<td valign="top">this type of image is what came to mind when i read the original description<br/>&amp; i''m a bit surprised there were not more of these <br/> <br/>best of luck</td>', 'this type of image is what came to mind when i read the original description& i''m a bit surprised there were not more of these  best of luck', '2006-07-07 10:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596736, 358319, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice layout and contrast.  I would like to see the overall focus of the image shifted to the front with the pen and first piece of paper equally in focus.</td>', 'Nice layout and contrast.  I would like to see the overall focus of the image shifted to the front with the pen and first piece of paper equally in focus.', '2006-07-07 10:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596738, 356687, 61679, '<td valign="top">The connection to the challenge is weak.  The execution of the concept is good.  I don''t think this will win a ribbon but it is a very nice image.</td>', 'The connection to the challenge is weak.  The execution of the concept is good.  I don''t think this will win a ribbon but it is a very nice image.', '2006-07-07 10:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596743, 356370, 61679, '<td valign="top">Very nice mood to this image.  I''m think the shadows from the candles onto the clay tablet hurt the composition just a bit.  Maybe if you moved the candles back away from the tablet that would help.</td>', 'Very nice mood to this image.  I''m think the shadows from the candles onto the clay tablet hurt the composition just a bit.  Maybe if you moved the candles back away from the tablet that would help.', '2006-07-07 10:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596746, 358048, 61679, '<td valign="top">Pleasing colors and flowing lines are well done.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the left.  Maybe if the camera was moved a little to the right the lighting might not have been as harsh.</td>', 'Pleasing colors and flowing lines are well done.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the left.  Maybe if the camera was moved a little to the right the lighting might not have been as harsh.', '2006-07-07 10:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596747, 358607, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words.  The shadow from the pink paper on the white paper is the only weak spot in this image.  Waiting for the wind to die down or spacing the paper further apart might have solved this issue.</td>', 'Nice play on words.  The shadow from the pink paper on the white paper is the only weak spot in this image.  Waiting for the wind to die down or spacing the paper further apart might have solved this issue.', '2006-07-07 10:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596752, 358399, 61679, '<td valign="top">A nice edgy feel to this image.  It would be nice if you could have eliminated the dark corner on the top left somehow.</td>', 'A nice edgy feel to this image.  It would be nice if you could have eliminated the dark corner on the top left somehow.', '2006-07-07 10:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596753, 358538, 61679, '<td valign="top">The lighting is well done.  I would remove the envelope on the left hand side, as it tends to draw attention away from the message.  I would also move the loose petal from underneath the rose and place it somewhere in the blank white space a little to the left of its current position.  The brown leaf on the right doesn''t really fit this image either.</td>', 'The lighting is well done.  I would remove the envelope on the left hand side, as it tends to draw attention away from the message.  I would also move the loose petal from underneath the rose and place it somewhere in the blank white space a little to the left of its current position.  The brown leaf on the right doesn''t really fit this image either.', '2006-07-07 10:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596756, 358562, 61679, '<td valign="top">The colors and arrangment is very nice.  The lighting leaves the image looking flat.  Moving the lighting to one side or the other would increase the shadows and help to provide some depth to the photo.</td>', 'The colors and arrangment is very nice.  The lighting leaves the image looking flat.  Moving the lighting to one side or the other would increase the shadows and help to provide some depth to the photo.', '2006-07-07 10:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596759, 356305, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice job under difficult lighting conditions.  The blown highlights will hurt your score a bit I''m afraid but it doesn''t distract from the focal point greatly in my opinon.  The image has a stock photo type look to it and overall deserves an above average score.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-12 06:28:34.</i></td>', 'Nice job under difficult lighting conditions.  The blown highlights will hurt your score a bit I''m afraid but it doesn''t distract from the focal point greatly in my opinon.  The image has a stock photo type look to it and overall deserves an above average score.', '2006-07-07 10:24:16.000000', '2006-07-12 07:28:34.000000', 1),
(2596760, 358659, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like your take on this challenge; however, I would have liked the whole airplane in focus.  The composition draws my eye to the tip of the plane, which is in focus but the colors on the wings draws my eyes back to the out of focus area.</td>', 'I like your take on this challenge; however, I would have liked the whole airplane in focus.  The composition draws my eye to the tip of the plane, which is in focus but the colors on the wings draws my eyes back to the out of focus area.', '2006-07-07 10:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596763, 355176, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot.  I think the interplay between the post-its and the CD would be stonger if the bill in the background was removed.  I would also rotate the pen a bit to show space between the body and the clip.</td>', 'I like this image a lot.  I think the interplay between the post-its and the CD would be stonger if the bill in the background was removed.  I would also rotate the pen a bit to show space between the body and the clip.', '2006-07-07 10:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596764, 356384, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice concept using parts of a pen.  The image would be stonger if you could have prevented the red colored glare in the background.  A solid entry.</td>', 'Nice concept using parts of a pen.  The image would be stonger if you could have prevented the red colored glare in the background.  A solid entry.', '2006-07-07 10:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596767, 358622, 61679, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very effective and I like your usage of the subject matter.  I would like to have seen less overlap of the two pushpins on the left and the red reflection in the center pushpin competes with the pushpins that are in focus as a focal point.</td>', 'The lighting is very effective and I like your usage of the subject matter.  I would like to have seen less overlap of the two pushpins on the left and the red reflection in the center pushpin competes with the pushpins that are in focus as a focal point.', '2006-07-07 10:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596768, 356024, 61679, '<td valign="top">The transition from the white base to the dark background gives the impression that the photo is not level.  Cropping the transtion out might help.  The colors, textures, and shadows work well together.</td>', 'The transition from the white base to the dark background gives the impression that the photo is not level.  Cropping the transtion out might help.  The colors, textures, and shadows work well together.', '2006-07-07 10:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596769, 355895, 61679, '<td valign="top">Great title and solid execution of the concept.  The out of focus section in the front left corner is very distracting and takes away from the overall appeal of the photo.</td>', 'Great title and solid execution of the concept.  The out of focus section in the front left corner is very distracting and takes away from the overall appeal of the photo.', '2006-07-07 10:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596770, 358181, 61679, '<td valign="top">The stationery appears to be taking a back seat (Pun intended) in this photo.  Technically the photo is well executed butt (intended also) there isn''t much there that appeals emotionally or to the eye.</td>', 'The stationery appears to be taking a back seat (Pun intended) in this photo.  Technically the photo is well executed butt (intended also) there isn''t much there that appeals emotionally or to the eye.', '2006-07-07 10:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596772, 358511, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image has a stock photo quality to it.  I would have liked to have seen the paper a little whiter and the phone rotated 180 degrees.</td>', 'This image has a stock photo quality to it.  I would have liked to have seen the paper a little whiter and the phone rotated 180 degrees.', '2006-07-07 10:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596773, 356780, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like how you included the actual component with the schematic.  The lighting is a little flat and I would have liked to have seen the paper a little whiter.</td>', 'I like how you included the actual component with the schematic.  The lighting is a little flat and I would have liked to have seen the paper a little whiter.', '2006-07-07 10:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596774, 358680, 61679, '<td valign="top">The lighting isn''t very effective in this photo.  The side of the TP roll is trying to blend into the background when it is really an important part of the composition.</td>', 'The lighting isn''t very effective in this photo.  The side of the TP roll is trying to blend into the background when it is really an important part of the composition.', '2006-07-07 10:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596775, 356877, 61679, '<td valign="top">Not quite stationary stationery, as it was moved from its orginal location to this display site.  This needs a little tweaking to bring out the colors and better define the 3D effect of the object.  The lighting makes it look a little flat.</td>', 'Not quite stationary stationery, as it was moved from its orginal location to this display site.  This needs a little tweaking to bring out the colors and better define the 3D effect of the object.  The lighting makes it look a little flat.', '2006-07-07 10:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596777, 356534, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice design and color but the image isn''t as tack sharp as it should be.</td>', 'Nice design and color but the image isn''t as tack sharp as it should be.', '2006-07-07 10:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596779, 358279, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion.  The vase really should have flowers in it or it shouldn''t be there.  The lighting leaves this image looking flat.  Wish I could tell you how to improve the lighting more.</td>', 'Nice compostion.  The vase really should have flowers in it or it shouldn''t be there.  The lighting leaves this image looking flat.  Wish I could tell you how to improve the lighting more.', '2006-07-07 10:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596780, 355714, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement of the card in the composition but the colors here just don''t work.  The flower needs to be whiter so it doesn''t fight with the colors in the stationery.</td>', 'I like the arrangement of the card in the composition but the colors here just don''t work.  The flower needs to be whiter so it doesn''t fight with the colors in the stationery.', '2006-07-07 10:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596782, 358533, 61679, '<td valign="top">Your title makes me want to look at the tips of the pencils to see if it is true.  However, the focus varies across the tips and I''m keep searching for where the picture wants me to focus.  Also, the compostion is a little out of balance, as the pencil on the left is cropped and the one on the right isn''t.</td>', 'Your title makes me want to look at the tips of the pencils to see if it is true.  However, the focus varies across the tips and I''m keep searching for where the picture wants me to focus.  Also, the compostion is a little out of balance, as the pencil on the left is cropped and the one on the right isn''t.', '2006-07-07 10:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596787, 357589, 61679, '<td valign="top">If the note was in better focus it would help the composition considerably.  I think the cropping at the top is a little tight as well when compared to the negative space at the bottom.</td>', 'If the note was in better focus it would help the composition considerably.  I think the cropping at the top is a little tight as well when compared to the negative space at the bottom.', '2006-07-07 10:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596789, 358074, 61679, '<td valign="top">The colors of the pencil holder need to pop more for this photo to be effective.  The background not being really black doesn''t help this issue and the black frame even more so.</td>', 'The colors of the pencil holder need to pop more for this photo to be effective.  The background not being really black doesn''t help this issue and the black frame even more so.', '2006-07-07 10:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596790, 357727, 61679, '<td valign="top">The depth of focus in this image could use a little adjustment.  I really want to read the entire message but can''t.  This forces me to look to the flower for a focal point and it isn''t.</td>', 'The depth of focus in this image could use a little adjustment.  I really want to read the entire message but can''t.  This forces me to look to the flower for a focal point and it isn''t.', '2006-07-07 10:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596791, 358352, 61679, '<td valign="top">The message and the bottle need to be in better focus to make them the focal point of the image.  As presented, the wood in the center of the image is the focal point.</td>', 'The message and the bottle need to be in better focus to make them the focal point of the image.  As presented, the wood in the center of the image is the focal point.', '2006-07-07 10:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596792, 358310, 61679, '<td valign="top">Posters don''t really convey stationery to me.  If a message was spray painted on the wall, it would better fit the title.  The image is well done and communicates the raw aspect of the streets.</td>', 'Posters don''t really convey stationery to me.  If a message was spray painted on the wall, it would better fit the title.  The image is well done and communicates the raw aspect of the streets.', '2006-07-07 10:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596793, 358387, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like this image but there are some conflicts between the items used within the composition.  The wax used to seal the letters conveys times long ago while the writing on the ink bottle are from the present.  I think the compositon would be a little stronger if both sealed letter were on the top shelf.  this would reduce the amount of negative space at the top right corner.  You could also reduce the negative space if you used a shorter candle.  This would allow you to crop off part of the top lid.</td>', 'I like this image but there are some conflicts between the items used within the composition.  The wax used to seal the letters conveys times long ago while the writing on the ink bottle are from the present.  I think the compositon would be a little stronger if both sealed letter were on the top shelf.  this would reduce the amount of negative space at the top right corner.  You could also reduce the negative space if you used a shorter candle.  This would allow you to crop off part of the top lid.', '2006-07-07 10:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596794, 357722, 61679, '<td valign="top">A nice image but the papyrus has no more appeal/pop then the green background behind it.  I''m really not sure how to improve this.</td>', 'A nice image but the papyrus has no more appeal/pop then the green background behind it.  I''m really not sure how to improve this.', '2006-07-07 10:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596797, 358281, 61679, '<td valign="top">If this were the strip from a real heart monitor, the beats would be continous along the length of the paper and not across.  Overall the lighting and composition are pleasing with the exception of the bright spot in the middle.</td>', 'If this were the strip from a real heart monitor, the beats would be continous along the length of the paper and not across.  Overall the lighting and composition are pleasing with the exception of the bright spot in the middle.', '2006-07-07 10:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596798, 355983, 61679, '<td valign="top">A nice piece of abstract art.  Basic editing hurts you a little here, as the dark spot on the far left could not be cloned out.</td>', 'A nice piece of abstract art.  Basic editing hurts you a little here, as the dark spot on the far left could not be cloned out.', '2006-07-07 10:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596801, 358497, 61679, '<td valign="top">Good focal point and lighting; however the background doesn''t work with this image.  The brown background sort of blends in with some of the pencil colors and steals the potential pop of this image.</td>', 'Good focal point and lighting; however the background doesn''t work with this image.  The brown background sort of blends in with some of the pencil colors and steals the potential pop of this image.', '2006-07-07 10:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596805, 358383, 61679, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge I''m guessing.  In general, the compostion and lighting in this image makes it one I would be proud to have shot myself.</td>', 'Wrong challenge I''m guessing.  In general, the compostion and lighting in this image makes it one I would be proud to have shot myself.', '2006-07-07 10:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596808, 355960, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image really needs to be a bit more high key to make it work.  The lines are very pleasing but I do not fully understand why the pencil is there.</td>', 'This image really needs to be a bit more high key to make it work.  The lines are very pleasing but I do not fully understand why the pencil is there.', '2006-07-07 10:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596811, 356412, 61679, '<td valign="top">An old typewriter is not the strongest example of stationery but I can accept it as meeting the challenge.  The image is kind of cluttered and the glare on sticker on the typewriter is a distraction.</td>', 'An old typewriter is not the strongest example of stationery but I can accept it as meeting the challenge.  The image is kind of cluttered and the glare on sticker on the typewriter is a distraction.', '2006-07-07 10:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596814, 357245, 61679, '<td valign="top">The concept is good but the image is lacking sharp focus where the eye is directed to look (at the cross point).  If you decide to reshoot this image, you may want to try showing the tip of the feather with ink stains to help drive your title home.</td>', 'The concept is good but the image is lacking sharp focus where the eye is directed to look (at the cross point).  If you decide to reshoot this image, you may want to try showing the tip of the feather with ink stains to help drive your title home.', '2006-07-07 10:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596818, 355294, 61679, '<td valign="top">A nice image but could use a little more contrast for my taste.  The softness of this image doesn''t really work due to the lack of contrast.  The grain look is very effective.</td>', 'A nice image but could use a little more contrast for my taste.  The softness of this image doesn''t really work due to the lack of contrast.  The grain look is very effective.', '2006-07-07 10:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596819, 357103, 61679, '<td valign="top">The concept is good and the placement of the letter is perfect.  I would like to see the model in a differnt position, as it is hard to determine if she is looking out the window or at the letter.</td>', 'The concept is good and the placement of the letter is perfect.  I would like to see the model in a differnt position, as it is hard to determine if she is looking out the window or at the letter.', '2006-07-07 10:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596821, 354977, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W conversion.  The paper is not really obvious in this photo.  The background behind the rock and cd is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Nice B&W conversion.  The paper is not really obvious in this photo.  The background behind the rock and cd is somewhat distracting.', '2006-07-07 10:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596824, 357549, 61679, '<td valign="top">The coloration by the candle light is appropriate for this composition.  The ink bottle is somewhat hidden by the glare of the candle and might be better seen if moved about level with the hand.  You might also want to try cropping the left side of the image to just left of the candle flame to help minimze the negative space at the top left corner.</td>', 'The coloration by the candle light is appropriate for this composition.  The ink bottle is somewhat hidden by the glare of the candle and might be better seen if moved about level with the hand.  You might also want to try cropping the left side of the image to just left of the candle flame to help minimze the negative space at the top left corner.', '2006-07-07 10:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596826, 356758, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but the fact that the hand isn''t grasping the pen hurts the execution of the concept.  I would also try a slightly different angle to eliminate the empty sleeve in the mirror.</td>', 'Nice concept but the fact that the hand isn''t grasping the pen hurts the execution of the concept.  I would also try a slightly different angle to eliminate the empty sleeve in the mirror.', '2006-07-07 10:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596827, 356980, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice stock image feel; however I''m having trouble finding a focal point for the image.  Either the front or the back of the image needs to be in focus to help give the image better definition.</td>', 'Nice stock image feel; however I''m having trouble finding a focal point for the image.  Either the front or the back of the image needs to be in focus to help give the image better definition.', '2006-07-07 10:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596828, 355807, 61679, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the pencil and the stationery.  The image would have been stronger without the vase and with a table cloth with less texture.</td>', 'I like the placement of the pencil and the stationery.  The image would have been stronger without the vase and with a table cloth with less texture.', '2006-07-07 10:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596829, 357819, 61679, '<td valign="top">For being the main focus of the composition, the corner should be in better focus.  It would have been nice to see something written in the ledger as well.</td>', 'For being the main focus of the composition, the corner should be in better focus.  It would have been nice to see something written in the ledger as well.', '2006-07-07 10:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596831, 356172, 61679, '<td valign="top">Pretty effective at what you were trying to accomplish; however, the glare from the light source takes away from the main topic of this entry.</td>', 'Pretty effective at what you were trying to accomplish; however, the glare from the light source takes away from the main topic of this entry.', '2006-07-07 10:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596832, 355712, 61679, '<td valign="top">This could use some different lighting, as it looks a little flat.  Maybe moving the light to the other side would help.</td>', 'This could use some different lighting, as it looks a little flat.  Maybe moving the light to the other side would help.', '2006-07-07 10:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596834, 358623, 61679, '<td valign="top">Everything about this image says tilted except the rod the coffee pots are hanging on.  It looks like things should be sliding off the back of the wagon.  The poll in front of the cowboy holding the write''n paper really hurts this image.  Since the colors aren''t very saturated, this would look better in B&amp;W or sepia.</td>', 'Everything about this image says tilted except the rod the coffee pots are hanging on.  It looks like things should be sliding off the back of the wagon.  The poll in front of the cowboy holding the write''n paper really hurts this image.  Since the colors aren''t very saturated, this would look better in B&W or sepia.', '2006-07-07 10:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596836, 356085, 61679, '<td valign="top">Nice image and well composed but I don''t see the connection to stationery.  If your intent is that the jewelery was used in place of stationery to convey his feelings, it doens''t communicate that well and I couldn''t have even make that connection without the title.  Sorry.</td>', 'Nice image and well composed but I don''t see the connection to stationery.  If your intent is that the jewelery was used in place of stationery to convey his feelings, it doens''t communicate that well and I couldn''t have even make that connection without the title.  Sorry.', '2006-07-07 10:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596838, 357977, 61679, '<td valign="top">You need to play around with the lighting a little bit her to help give this image more definition and appeal.  The background would improve considerably if it were a brighter white and the depth of focus is a bit too shallow on the pens.</td>', 'You need to play around with the lighting a little bit her to help give this image more definition and appeal.  The background would improve considerably if it were a brighter white and the depth of focus is a bit too shallow on the pens.', '2006-07-07 10:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596839, 357604, 61679, '<td valign="top">The concept is good but the execution would have been better if the school supplies were placed on a desk in the corner.  As is, the background is busy and distracts from the main subject.</td>', 'The concept is good but the execution would have been better if the school supplies were placed on a desk in the corner.  As is, the background is busy and distracts from the main subject.', '2006-07-07 10:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596840, 358664, 61679, '<td valign="top">Wow, you chose some tough lighting conditions to shoot under.  At first I wondered if a post card was really stationery but since you can write a message on the back it certainly is.  I don''t think the black and white conversion works with this photo.  Maybe more contrast would help but I''m willing to bet that the post card would suffer greatly.</td>', 'Wow, you chose some tough lighting conditions to shoot under.  At first I wondered if a post card was really stationery but since you can write a message on the back it certainly is.  I don''t think the black and white conversion works with this photo.  Maybe more contrast would help but I''m willing to bet that the post card would suffer greatly.', '2006-07-07 10:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596844, 356244, 61679, '<td valign="top">A nice play on words.  The hand needs more light on it to better convey your intent.  It would also help if the background didn''t have such a strong light source, as it draws my eyes away from the intended focus point of your entry.</td>', 'A nice play on words.  The hand needs more light on it to better convey your intent.  It would also help if the background didn''t have such a strong light source, as it draws my eyes away from the intended focus point of your entry.', '2006-07-07 10:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596845, 356607, 61679, '<td valign="top">This image might be cropped to tightly, as there isn''t enough window frame to help convey that the writing is on a window.  It is more of a distraction.</td>', 'This image might be cropped to tightly, as there isn''t enough window frame to help convey that the writing is on a window.  It is more of a distraction.', '2006-07-07 10:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596848, 357532, 61679, '<td valign="top">I think you entered the wrong challenge.  Even if this were the Stationary Challenge, the bee is still in flight and wouldn''t really fit well into the challenge.  You might also want to check you photo size before your next submission.<br/> <br/>Edit for spelling<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-07-13 13:02:13.</i></td>', 'I think you entered the wrong challenge.  Even if this were the Stationary Challenge, the bee is still in flight and wouldn''t really fit well into the challenge.  You might also want to check you photo size before your next submission. Edit for spelling', '2006-07-07 10:34:04.000000', '2006-07-13 14:02:13.000000', 1),
(2596850, 358095, 61679, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is or how it relates to the challenge.  The lighting makes the overall appearance of the image look flat.</td>', 'Not sure what it is or how it relates to the challenge.  The lighting makes the overall appearance of the image look flat.', '2006-07-07 10:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596852, 358397, 61679, '<td valign="top">My guess is this is in the wrong challenge.  In general, the focus is a little soft at the top of the rope and the backround is more of a distraction than a help with this image.</td>', 'My guess is this is in the wrong challenge.  In general, the focus is a little soft at the top of the rope and the backround is more of a distraction than a help with this image.', '2006-07-07 10:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596854, 357191, 61679, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge I''m betting.  Even for the Stationary challenge this picture would be average at best.  The background is very busy and the person in the mirror appears to be out of focus.</td>', 'Wrong challenge I''m betting.  Even for the Stationary challenge this picture would be average at best.  The background is very busy and the person in the mirror appears to be out of focus.', '2006-07-07 10:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596860, 355841, 61679, '<td valign="top">The shallow depth of field is hurting this image considerably.  I like that you carried the Japanese theme into the background of the image; however, a tighter crop to eliminate the basic green-blue areas in the back corners would help the overall composition.</td>', 'The shallow depth of field is hurting this image considerably.  I like that you carried the Japanese theme into the background of the image; however, a tighter crop to eliminate the basic green-blue areas in the back corners would help the overall composition.', '2006-07-07 10:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596948, 358664, 33560, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  It takes some time for it to make an impact.  But the more I look at it the more I like it. <br/> <br/>Isn''t it interesting how once the plaza had space for a numer of international flags but now its dozens of flagpoles fit only American ones?</td>', 'Clever idea.  It takes some time for it to make an impact.  But the more I look at it the more I like it.  Isn''t it interesting how once the plaza had space for a numer of international flags but now its dozens of flagpoles fit only American ones?', '2006-07-07 11:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596955, 356678, 33560, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Great lighting.  I think I might have desaturated that tie a little  more.  And I find the vertical crack a little distracting.</td>', 'Great idea. Great lighting.  I think I might have desaturated that tie a little  more.  And I find the vertical crack a little distracting.', '2006-07-07 11:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596968, 354935, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the idea.  Photographically speaking the execution is superb.  It seems like it ought to be a quibble, but I really find the font on the document to look too anachronistic.  The message in a bottle is a seventeenth century thing, isn''t it?</td>', 'I love the idea.  Photographically speaking the execution is superb.  It seems like it ought to be a quibble, but I really find the font on the document to look too anachronistic.  The message in a bottle is a seventeenth century thing, isn''t it?', '2006-07-07 11:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596979, 358285, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very funny, but I''m not sure it will score well,  Flowers are  tough to do well.  Since stationary is supposed to be the subject, but photographically the flowers are the subject here the photo does not fit the challenge well.  The lighting causes a number of problems; glare on the glass and a distracting light ''hot spot'' on the backdrop.  On a positive note, I like blue.</td>', 'Very funny, but I''m not sure it will score well,  Flowers are  tough to do well.  Since stationary is supposed to be the subject, but photographically the flowers are the subject here the photo does not fit the challenge well.  The lighting causes a number of problems; glare on the glass and a distracting light ''hot spot'' on the backdrop.  On a positive note, I like blue.', '2006-07-07 11:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596982, 358541, 33560, '<td valign="top">A lovely arrangement of stationary pencils.  Does one draw on stationery?  I hope so, because I like this photo.</td>', 'A lovely arrangement of stationary pencils.  Does one draw on stationery?  I hope so, because I like this photo.', '2006-07-07 11:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2596992, 356362, 33560, '<td valign="top">The form is interesting.  I like the repeating and amplifying loops.  There is a sense, however, that the highlights are blown.  And I  guess I don''t get the great empty space at the top ( if  the title is referring to the great vacuum of space, then we would be expecting to see the pen at some distance from paper floating in the blackness of space as in "Pen to paper, pen to paper. Come in paper.  Over" )</td>', 'The form is interesting.  I like the repeating and amplifying loops.  There is a sense, however, that the highlights are blown.  And I  guess I don''t get the great empty space at the top ( if  the title is referring to the great vacuum of space, then we would be expecting to see the pen at some distance from paper floating in the blackness of space as in "Pen to paper, pen to paper. Come in paper.  Over" )', '2006-07-07 11:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597040, 356384, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love this photo: the natural textures, the two-toned light and the simplicity of design.   It takes a bit of time to understand that this is a piece of a writing instrument...</td>', 'I love this photo: the natural textures, the two-toned light and the simplicity of design.   It takes a bit of time to understand that this is a piece of a writing instrument...', '2006-07-07 11:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597072, 356172, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.    I find the glare on the wall rather distracting.  And I wish the paper had no lines and showed more texture.  Knowing I usually crop too tightly, I think the photo would be a bit better with some cropped from the bottom.  Finally, I might have played with hue and saturation a bit.  This photo might be better as a sepia or b&amp;w to emphasize the form rather than the color - which is not that interesting.</td>', 'I like the idea.    I find the glare on the wall rather distracting.  And I wish the paper had no lines and showed more texture.  Knowing I usually crop too tightly, I think the photo would be a bit better with some cropped from the bottom.  Finally, I might have played with hue and saturation a bit.  This photo might be better as a sepia or b&w to emphasize the form rather than the color - which is not that interesting.', '2006-07-07 11:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2597110, 355289, 28532, '<td valign="top">Great shot ~ I like the uniqueness of the subject in relationship to the  challenge!  Well done!</td>', 'Great shot ~ I like the uniqueness of the subject in relationship to the  challenge!  Well done!', '2006-07-07 11:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
