(2598449, 358048, 48456, '<td valign="top">done many times before but i think the fact that your paper is purpuley-pink makes it very disco and very different which makes it stand out in my eyes and give it a high score. my sole disapointement is the fact that the title is so unstimulating. im giving you a 9 and hope that you find a backup unofficial better title.</td>', 'done many times before but i think the fact that your paper is purpuley-pink makes it very disco and very different which makes it stand out in my eyes and give it a high score. my sole disapointement is the fact that the title is so unstimulating. im giving you a 9 and hope that you find a backup unofficial better title.', '2006-07-07 18:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598466, 358405, 48456, '<td valign="top">very cool concept i would have pushed firther with stationery for the background, its hard to know what this background is. you get a 10 for originality</td>', 'very cool concept i would have pushed firther with stationery for the background, its hard to know what this background is. you get a 10 for originality', '2006-07-07 18:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
