(2598739, 357519, 61191, '<td valign="top">I like this. Great that you can see the paper''s texture. I especially like that the letter is nearly empty.</td>', 'I like this. Great that you can see the paper''s texture. I especially like that the letter is nearly empty.', '2006-07-07 20:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598743, 358699, 61505, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of DOF. Love the crop as well. Some might suggest for it to be tighter on the ride side but I believe it shows just enough shadow to "fill" the frame. Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice use of DOF. Love the crop as well. Some might suggest for it to be tighter on the ride side but I believe it shows just enough shadow to "fill" the frame. Nice job.', '2006-07-07 20:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598752, 358699, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, and an interesting DOF. I also like the light gradient you achieved behind the pencil holder.(and across the bottom of the cup) I may have tried the pencil the other way.</td>', 'Nice perspective, and an interesting DOF. I also like the light gradient you achieved behind the pencil holder.(and across the bottom of the cup) I may have tried the pencil the other way.', '2006-07-07 20:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598755, 358223, 33672, '<td valign="top">The lighting gives it an authentic feel but doesn''t help the contrast. (Which I feel a bit more is needed)</td>', 'The lighting gives it an authentic feel but doesn''t help the contrast. (Which I feel a bit more is needed)', '2006-07-07 20:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598759, 358631, 33672, '<td valign="top">Interesting comp and idea. Colors need more saturation and this could be a ribbon contender.</td>', 'Interesting comp and idea. Colors need more saturation and this could be a ribbon contender.', '2006-07-07 20:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598762, 357967, 33672, '<td valign="top">I thought it was my fortune.....Nice focus and clarity on a difficult to shoot subject.</td>', 'I thought it was my fortune.....Nice focus and clarity on a difficult to shoot subject.', '2006-07-07 20:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598798, 357870, 61191, '<td valign="top">Like this chinese stuff. Calm an well composed image. Unfortunately a bit blurry.</td>', 'Like this chinese stuff. Calm an well composed image. Unfortunately a bit blurry.', '2006-07-07 21:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598873, 357103, 48890, '<td valign="top">Pretty hard to imagine that, having written (or, maybe, received) a goodbye letter, someone would decide to go and sit naked in front of the window.  Since there is a plot in this shot, I have to point out that the plot is not believable.  Other than that, the composition is good, light is interesting, the model''s pose is bitter-sweet pensive and unnatural. 5</td>', 'Pretty hard to imagine that, having written (or, maybe, received) a goodbye letter, someone would decide to go and sit naked in front of the window.  Since there is a plot in this shot, I have to point out that the plot is not believable.  Other than that, the composition is good, light is interesting, the model''s pose is bitter-sweet pensive and unnatural. 5', '2006-07-07 21:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598878, 358696, 48890, '<td valign="top">Colours are popping, and the lines are intersting, creating a nice rhythm.  The shot is a little bit boring, the eye is searching for something to follow.</td>', 'Colours are popping, and the lines are intersting, creating a nice rhythm.  The shot is a little bit boring, the eye is searching for something to follow.', '2006-07-07 21:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
