(2600339, 356453, 53147, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this would have looked like with just the rolled paper on a solid background. The flat sheets edges are a bit distracting as they are not evenly spaced and seem to throw off the balance a bit.</td>', 'I wonder what this would have looked like with just the rolled paper on a solid background. The flat sheets edges are a bit distracting as they are not evenly spaced and seem to throw off the balance a bit.', '2006-07-08 11:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
