(2606535, 357872, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is a neat idea, and the shot itself is very well done, but I can''t tell what the stationery is, which bugs me.  Without the title, I think I would have had a hard time knowing that''s what the reflection was.</td>', 'This is a neat idea, and the shot itself is very well done, but I can''t tell what the stationery is, which bugs me.  Without the title, I think I would have had a hard time knowing that''s what the reflection was.', '2006-07-10 09:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606539, 357437, 40355, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I love the light between the pages.  10</td>', 'Great shot, I love the light between the pages.  10', '2006-07-10 09:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606545, 354935, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  Colors are crisp, image sharp, and overall composition is interesting.  Including the hands opening the bottle was a good touch.  Hope to see this in the top 3.   10</td>', 'Very well done!  Colors are crisp, image sharp, and overall composition is interesting.  Including the hands opening the bottle was a good touch.  Hope to see this in the top 3.   10', '2006-07-10 10:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606551, 358352, 40355, '<td valign="top">The bottle is hard to see here and gets lost in the pilings.  A tighter crop would have been better.</td>', 'The bottle is hard to see here and gets lost in the pilings.  A tighter crop would have been better.', '2006-07-10 10:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606554, 358399, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro, the level of detail in the objects is great.</td>', 'Very nice macro, the level of detail in the objects is great.', '2006-07-10 10:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606557, 358119, 40355, '<td valign="top">Now this is morbid...  ;-)</td>', 'Now this is morbid...  ;-)', '2006-07-10 10:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2606562, 358304, 40355, '<td valign="top">LOL  Okay, so suicide isn''t funny, but the idea of someone rewriting multiple drafts of their suicide note for proper grammer is.  I''ll have to share this one with my fellow English majors.  Best of luck to you!  9</td>', 'LOL  Okay, so suicide isn''t funny, but the idea of someone rewriting multiple drafts of their suicide note for proper grammer is.  I''ll have to share this one with my fellow English majors.  Best of luck to you!  9', '2006-07-10 10:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
