(2606581, 357646, 40355, '<td valign="top">AH, so <i>you''re</i> responsible for the Post-It note shortage!  ;-)  Good concept, nice shot.  A bit brighter might have been good.  8</td>', 'AH, so you''re responsible for the Post-It note shortage!  ;-)  Good concept, nice shot.  A bit brighter might have been good.  8', '2006-07-10 10:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
