(2607457, 356650, 59754, '<td valign="top">Neato, I love the use of the thin DOF.  Excellent PP as well, the haze is not at all gross as it sometimes can be.  I can''t wait to see how wide the aperture was (I''d say 1.4 if I was a bettin'' man).</td>', 'Neato, I love the use of the thin DOF.  Excellent PP as well, the haze is not at all gross as it sometimes can be.  I can''t wait to see how wide the aperture was (I''d say 1.4 if I was a bettin'' man).', '2006-07-10 14:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
