(2610246, 357589, 57400, '<td valign="top">Ouch! How sad for whomever sent their love... I guess. The photo is somewhat ambiguous as related to the subject, but there is a relationship. The photo conveys the flames well, although the composition could be slightly improved, enlarging the "stationery".</td>', 'Ouch! How sad for whomever sent their love... I guess. The photo is somewhat ambiguous as related to the subject, but there is a relationship. The photo conveys the flames well, although the composition could be slightly improved, enlarging the "stationery".', '2006-07-11 08:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610250, 355631, 57400, '<td valign="top">Paper, yes; but stationery is not exclusively understood. Japanese, yes; but even I know how to make these, so that isn''t exclusive either, as I''m not Japanese. The photo of the oragami crane is beautiful nonetheless.</td>', 'Paper, yes; but stationery is not exclusively understood. Japanese, yes; but even I know how to make these, so that isn''t exclusive either, as I''m not Japanese. The photo of the oragami crane is beautiful nonetheless.', '2006-07-11 08:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610251, 358538, 57400, '<td valign="top">Yes, clearly stationery, and with a poignantly depicted message that rends the heart! Colors, shapes, and subject matter are well composed and understood.</td>', 'Yes, clearly stationery, and with a poignantly depicted message that rends the heart! Colors, shapes, and subject matter are well composed and understood.', '2006-07-11 08:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610255, 357103, 57400, '<td valign="top">What is this half-naked woman doing in relation to the pen and paper lying on the floor? Too staged and a stretch to imagine the connection. It''s not a photo I care for and seems like a sneaky way to combine unrelated elements.</td>', 'What is this half-naked woman doing in relation to the pen and paper lying on the floor? Too staged and a stretch to imagine the connection. It''s not a photo I care for and seems like a sneaky way to combine unrelated elements.', '2006-07-11 08:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610260, 358583, 57400, '<td valign="top">Does that mean: "paper" or "cranes" or "no birds allowed"??? Unclear, although it could well be stationery.</td>', 'Does that mean: "paper" or "cranes" or "no birds allowed"??? Unclear, although it could well be stationery.', '2006-07-11 08:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610265, 358285, 57400, '<td valign="top">Rather inventive, but a stretch. The photo is pleassing in color and composition, even if the concept is slightly vague.</td>', 'Rather inventive, but a stretch. The photo is pleassing in color and composition, even if the concept is slightly vague.', '2006-07-11 08:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610268, 357604, 57400, '<td valign="top">Notebooks, yes; but not stationery. Maybe stationery items... photo is clear, but lacks clarity of intent. the title m ay help to discover the photo''s meaning, but it isn''t initially clear.</td>', 'Notebooks, yes; but not stationery. Maybe stationery items... photo is clear, but lacks clarity of intent. the title m ay help to discover the photo''s meaning, but it isn''t initially clear.', '2006-07-11 08:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610272, 355807, 57400, '<td valign="top">Yes, stationery. The photo composition and clarity are not the best, but the subject matter matches the challenge. Hooray!</td>', 'Yes, stationery. The photo composition and clarity are not the best, but the subject matter matches the challenge. Hooray!', '2006-07-11 08:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610279, 355983, 57400, '<td valign="top">Nooooo.... this is very unclear to me what is being depicted. It may well be stationery, and it is very clear and colorful, but it looks more like a TV station "Off the Air" pattern!!!</td>', 'Nooooo.... this is very unclear to me what is being depicted. It may well be stationery, and it is very clear and colorful, but it looks more like a TV station "Off the Air" pattern!!!', '2006-07-11 08:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610281, 358527, 57400, '<td valign="top">Yes, paper, and very colorful paper at that, but not stationery.</td>', 'Yes, paper, and very colorful paper at that, but not stationery.', '2006-07-11 08:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610286, 354970, 57400, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo. It is difficult to get a sense of size, as quilling paper is usually small in scale, but this may be made of larger sheets... Unfortunately, this is hard to connect with the subject of the challenge.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo. It is difficult to get a sense of size, as quilling paper is usually small in scale, but this may be made of larger sheets... Unfortunately, this is hard to connect with the subject of the challenge.', '2006-07-11 08:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610299, 357065, 57400, '<td valign="top">Photo of stationery up close, no doubt, but why? Are congratulations in order? Something''s missing.</td>', 'Photo of stationery up close, no doubt, but why? Are congratulations in order? Something''s missing.', '2006-07-11 08:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610303, 357220, 57400, '<td valign="top">Funny photographer... and at least half witty! Nicely done.</td>', 'Funny photographer... and at least half witty! Nicely done.', '2006-07-11 08:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610308, 358664, 57400, '<td valign="top">Nice composition of a clever idea. i suppose a post card is a type of stationery. OK.</td>', 'Nice composition of a clever idea. i suppose a post card is a type of stationery. OK.', '2006-07-11 08:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610313, 357977, 57400, '<td valign="top">Colorful macro composition, but falls short of meeting the challenge for me. Wait! Is that writing paper in the distance?</td>', 'Colorful macro composition, but falls short of meeting the challenge for me. Wait! Is that writing paper in the distance?', '2006-07-11 08:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610317, 358647, 57400, '<td valign="top">I guess I''m not techno-savvy enough to understand this photo. Forgive me.</td>', 'I guess I''m not techno-savvy enough to understand this photo. Forgive me.', '2006-07-11 08:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610318, 358399, 57400, '<td valign="top">Exceptional macro image, but barely related to the challenge concept.</td>', 'Exceptional macro image, but barely related to the challenge concept.', '2006-07-11 08:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610320, 356877, 57400, '<td valign="top">Another clever play on images... I like.</td>', 'Another clever play on images... I like.', '2006-07-11 08:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610322, 357722, 57400, '<td valign="top">Yes, and a fine photo image of this material. I can''t argue with the facts nor the photos of the matter.</td>', 'Yes, and a fine photo image of this material. I can''t argue with the facts nor the photos of the matter.', '2006-07-11 08:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610327, 355831, 57400, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image that I wouldn''t readily recognize without the title, but acceptably unrecognizable as stationery-with-a-twist. Very pleasing image.</td>', 'Wonderful image that I wouldn''t readily recognize without the title, but acceptably unrecognizable as stationery-with-a-twist. Very pleasing image.', '2006-07-11 08:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
