(2610331, 358181, 57400, '<td valign="top">Peculiar perpective, but a clean shot! I am ambivalent about this image... and that means it is definitely conveying something. I''m glad it''s not my stationery though.</td>', 'Peculiar perpective, but a clean shot! I am ambivalent about this image... and that means it is definitely conveying something. I''m glad it''s not my stationery though.', '2006-07-11 08:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
