(2610350, 354970, 27524, '<td valign="top">This is very nice idea...I like the colors and shapes. Only thing that the border could be bit more descreet...takes too much attention out of picture.</td>', 'This is very nice idea...I like the colors and shapes. Only thing that the border could be bit more descreet...takes too much attention out of picture.', '2006-07-11 08:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
