(2610550, 358106, 57400, '<td valign="top">Although unconventional, the idea of stone stationery is conveyed fairly well, with the additional element of having the message underlined by the red taillights passing. The image might be improved if the "writer" were in the photo, weilding his spray can as he scribes his message on the wall.</td>', 'Although unconventional, the idea of stone stationery is conveyed fairly well, with the additional element of having the message underlined by the red taillights passing. The image might be improved if the "writer" were in the photo, weilding his spray can as he scribes his message on the wall.', '2006-07-11 09:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610555, 355294, 57400, '<td valign="top">The view from having one''s chin resting on the paper? It seems crowded,  but at least is stationery.</td>', 'The view from having one''s chin resting on the paper? It seems crowded,  but at least is stationery.', '2006-07-11 09:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610558, 355931, 57400, '<td valign="top">Over my head... I''m only 5''5" tall.</td>', 'Over my head... I''m only 5''5" tall.', '2006-07-11 09:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610694, 356137, 47852, '<td valign="top">Trying to leave some more in depth comments on random photos, so here goes...<br/> <br/>The first thing I noticed about this shot was the star shape reflections at the corners of the laser lights.  I like how they seem to get bigger as they go up.  I also like the slight blue cast of the second light coming from the top.  Suggestions for improvement?  Maybe light the back edges a bit more or crop in tighter?  Nicely done!</td>', 'Trying to leave some more in depth comments on random photos, so here goes... The first thing I noticed about this shot was the star shape reflections at the corners of the laser lights.  I like how they seem to get bigger as they go up.  I also like the slight blue cast of the second light coming from the top.  Suggestions for improvement?  Maybe light the back edges a bit more or crop in tighter?  Nicely done!', '2006-07-11 11:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610709, 357437, 47852, '<td valign="top">Trying to leave some more in depth comments on random photos, so here goes...<br/> <br/>I like the unique perspective here, its much more interesting than a typical still shot of a diary with pen.  The soft colors and reflections of color in the pages are wonderful.  The movement of the pages is interesting, the pages are well focused with just a little bit of the movement being apparent, which unexpected, but nice.  Suggestions for improvement?  Maybe a slight crop to get rid of some of the dark colors on the bottom and right?  I think you pulled this together very nicely.  Well done and good luck!</td>', 'Trying to leave some more in depth comments on random photos, so here goes... I like the unique perspective here, its much more interesting than a typical still shot of a diary with pen.  The soft colors and reflections of color in the pages are wonderful.  The movement of the pages is interesting, the pages are well focused with just a little bit of the movement being apparent, which unexpected, but nice.  Suggestions for improvement?  Maybe a slight crop to get rid of some of the dark colors on the bottom and right?  I think you pulled this together very nicely.  Well done and good luck!', '2006-07-11 11:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610712, 357809, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like this alot; it really pops out, perhaps a more prominent border? great work!</td>', 'I like this alot; it really pops out, perhaps a more prominent border? great work!', '2006-07-11 11:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610717, 358311, 47852, '<td valign="top">Trying to leave some more in depth comments on random photos, so here goes...<br/> <br/>I like the slight tilt of the papers in the frame of the shot and the duotone coloring, though it seems just a tad yellow and I might have made it a bit more brown.  Considering that I can''t read what is written on the paper, I think if I had been able to it might distract from the idea of the photo, so it was a good choice.  Suggestions for improvement?  Besides the possible change in color for the duotoning, it seems like the tips of the fingers get lost in the lighting, and I''d like to see a bit more definition there.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Trying to leave some more in depth comments on random photos, so here goes... I like the slight tilt of the papers in the frame of the shot and the duotone coloring, though it seems just a tad yellow and I might have made it a bit more brown.  Considering that I can''t read what is written on the paper, I think if I had been able to it might distract from the idea of the photo, so it was a good choice.  Suggestions for improvement?  Besides the possible change in color for the duotoning, it seems like the tips of the fingers get lost in the lighting, and I''d like to see a bit more definition there.  Nicely done!', '2006-07-11 11:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2610795, 357646, 58999, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent idea and very well executed. I like the lighting and tones.</td>', 'This is an excellent idea and very well executed. I like the lighting and tones.', '2006-07-11 12:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
