(2610864, 358106, 60799, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  The red streaks of the car lights (is that what they''re from) against the stone background work very nicely together.  I''m sure that this will recieve MANY dnmc votes, and if you look at the literal defination it probably dosen''t... BUT if you look at it from a perspective a little off the norm I think it fits perfectly. 9 and my favorite from the group.  Original.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  The red streaks of the car lights (is that what they''re from) against the stone background work very nicely together.  I''m sure that this will recieve MANY dnmc votes, and if you look at the literal defination it probably dosen''t... BUT if you look at it from a perspective a little off the norm I think it fits perfectly. 9 and my favorite from the group.  Original.', '2006-07-11 12:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
