(2611636, 355841, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors and shapes, but a little too busy.  Is your subject the symbols or the swan?  If the swan, it''s not sharp enough.</td>', 'Interesting colors and shapes, but a little too busy.  Is your subject the symbols or the swan?  If the swan, it''s not sharp enough.', '2006-07-11 18:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611643, 358607, 54369, '<td valign="top">its fun and interesting! Great job!</td>', 'its fun and interesting! Great job!', '2006-07-11 18:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611644, 358643, 60862, '<td valign="top">A little too busy.  I can''t tell whether I should look at the book, the plane, the piece on the left, or the jumble at the top.  All of the colors and shapes draw my attention.<br/> <br/>Try to pick one subject and get rid of everything that doesn''t focus attention on it.</td>', 'A little too busy.  I can''t tell whether I should look at the book, the plane, the piece on the left, or the jumble at the top.  All of the colors and shapes draw my attention. Try to pick one subject and get rid of everything that doesn''t focus attention on it.', '2006-07-11 18:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611646, 355931, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and colors.  However, the overall composition doesn''t really grab me.</td>', 'Nice shapes and colors.  However, the overall composition doesn''t really grab me.', '2006-07-11 18:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611650, 358583, 60862, '<td valign="top">Better than a couple of other origami shots because it''s much simpler.  But here, I''d like the swans to be a different color so they pop out from the background paper.</td>', 'Better than a couple of other origami shots because it''s much simpler.  But here, I''d like the swans to be a different color so they pop out from the background paper.', '2006-07-11 18:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611652, 357597, 60862, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  Nice concept. Gorgeous lighting, great use of only one color, and a strong one at that.</td>', 'Lovely!  Nice concept. Gorgeous lighting, great use of only one color, and a strong one at that.', '2006-07-11 18:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611653, 358663, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!</td>', 'Very pretty!', '2006-07-11 18:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
