(2611657, 356412, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the overall feel.  The distressed table really adds to the feeling of the old typewriter.</td>', 'I like the overall feel.  The distressed table really adds to the feeling of the old typewriter.', '2006-07-11 18:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
