(2611674, 357148, 60862, '<td valign="top">The white paper kind of gets lost.  I like the composition overall, but maybe a brightly colored note would work better?</td>', 'The white paper kind of gets lost.  I like the composition overall, but maybe a brightly colored note would work better?', '2006-07-11 18:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611677, 358410, 60862, '<td valign="top">This would work better with the whole plan in focus, and a brightly colored and lit piece of paper.  White on white doesn''t grab my eye.</td>', 'This would work better with the whole plan in focus, and a brightly colored and lit piece of paper.  White on white doesn''t grab my eye.', '2006-07-11 18:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611680, 358279, 60862, '<td valign="top">Better lighting would improve this shot.  You''ve got nice, interesting subjects, and I can tell there are bright colors in there.  But it needs more contrast and more light.</td>', 'Better lighting would improve this shot.  You''ve got nice, interesting subjects, and I can tell there are bright colors in there.  But it needs more contrast and more light.', '2006-07-11 18:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611685, 358511, 60862, '<td valign="top">Heh.  Nice composition and the pencil really drives my eye toward the corner of the paper.<br/> <br/>What''s the purpose of the phone?  I was expecting a title like "Order Now!"</td>', 'Heh.  Nice composition and the pencil really drives my eye toward the corner of the paper. What''s the purpose of the phone?  I was expecting a title like "Order Now!"', '2006-07-11 18:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611687, 358223, 60862, '<td valign="top">A little too dark and not enough contrast.</td>', 'A little too dark and not enough contrast.', '2006-07-11 18:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611690, 355807, 60862, '<td valign="top">Think about your "story."  What were you trying to convey here?  The pages look filled, so the title doesn''t resonate with me. And I don''t seem to find a particular subject.<br/> <br/>Finally, on the technical side, the contrast needs to be higher.</td>', 'Think about your "story."  What were you trying to convey here?  The pages look filled, so the title doesn''t resonate with me. And I don''t seem to find a particular subject. Finally, on the technical side, the contrast needs to be higher.', '2006-07-11 18:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611694, 354977, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and I like the juxtaposition of old and new "stationery."  Definitely way outside the box, but that''s okay with me.<br/> <br/>However, there''s not enough "pop" - needs more contrast.</td>', 'I like the idea, and I like the juxtaposition of old and new "stationery."  Definitely way outside the box, but that''s okay with me. However, there''s not enough "pop" - needs more contrast.', '2006-07-11 18:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2611697, 358399, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Would it work a little better with more space at the top?</td>', 'Very nice.  Would it work a little better with more space at the top?', '2006-07-11 18:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
