(2611731, 358639, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and idea.<br/> <br/>I think you used narrow DOF to focus on the letter, but the pen is distracting me.  I think if it had been in focus, it wouldn''t do that.  Go figger.<br/> <br/>As for the paper itself, it''s not quite bright enough.  I get the impression of someone writing this in a very dim room.</td>', 'I like the composition and idea. I think you used narrow DOF to focus on the letter, but the pen is distracting me.  I think if it had been in focus, it wouldn''t do that.  Go figger. As for the paper itself, it''s not quite bright enough.  I get the impression of someone writing this in a very dim room.', '2006-07-11 18:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
