(2614006, 357809, 35892, '<td valign="top">i''m no expert but i think this picture shows a lot of thought and creativity, it -to me-has good color-lighting and composition, which makes it a good picture. i personally don''t think you should judge any of your pictures by the scores they receive here-i think you should judge them by how they make you feel,if you are happy with them then that is all that is necessary. the only other thing that would be important is if you were shooting this for someone else-then they would need to like it for you to have done a good job. too many people on this website are self proclaimed experts and judge pics by their standards of either limited or vast knowledge and many wouldn''t really know a good shot if it hit them in the head.keep shooting what you like that is what is important.</td>', 'i''m no expert but i think this picture shows a lot of thought and creativity, it -to me-has good color-lighting and composition, which makes it a good picture. i personally don''t think you should judge any of your pictures by the scores they receive here-i think you should judge them by how they make you feel,if you are happy with them then that is all that is necessary. the only other thing that would be important is if you were shooting this for someone else-then they would need to like it for you to have done a good job. too many people on this website are self proclaimed experts and judge pics by their standards of either limited or vast knowledge and many wouldn''t really know a good shot if it hit them in the head.keep shooting what you like that is what is important.', '2006-07-12 08:31:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2614007, 358541, 43714, '<td valign="top">SO HAPPY FOR YOU CHEZ!!!! You so deserve frpnt page, your family is proud!</td>', 'SO HAPPY FOR YOU CHEZ!!!! You so deserve frpnt page, your family is proud!', '2006-07-12 08:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2614009, 357646, 48115, '<td valign="top">wow congrats :)this is such a cool idea! Love your work man keep it up<br/></td>', 'wow congrats :)this is such a cool idea! Love your work man keep it up', '2006-07-12 08:32:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2614039, 358622, 38732, '<td valign="top">It''s unfortunate that so many people have a closed concept of what stationery means, as I''m sure your score suffered from it.<br/> <br/>What I like about this shot is the simplicity, the creative lighting and the focus of the two pins in the front.  I think I would have preferred a little more DOF to either just get the closest pin totally in focus, or perhaps even to get a few more of the pins a little more focused...not sure which would be better.  After some time, I finally noticed the bit of red on one of the pins, which might be a distraction for some.<br/> <br/>Don''t let your score or the DNMC comments get you down.  Just learn what you can from the shot and the comments, and use that in your future challenges :)</td>', 'It''s unfortunate that so many people have a closed concept of what stationery means, as I''m sure your score suffered from it. What I like about this shot is the simplicity, the creative lighting and the focus of the two pins in the front.  I think I would have preferred a little more DOF to either just get the closest pin totally in focus, or perhaps even to get a few more of the pins a little more focused...not sure which would be better.  After some time, I finally noticed the bit of red on one of the pins, which might be a distraction for some. Don''t let your score or the DNMC comments get you down.  Just learn what you can from the shot and the comments, and use that in your future challenges :)', '2006-07-12 08:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2614045, 357809, 45475, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I didn''t get the time to come back to this and comment before end of voting. However, I did score this an 8. It''s beautiful. I can easily see the amount of time and effort you''ve put into it and IMHO, has paid off for you. What I find hard to understand are the dnmcs.<br/> <br/>In light of the comments, I''d have to say that those folk probably didn''t spend a heck of a lot of time looking at this image. A quick glance most likely gave an impression of party decorations, and so, they were unable to reconcile the arrangement with actual stationery...? Who knows. I''m just thinking out loud here anyway :)<br/> <br/>Both yours and Tim''s work are truly inspiring. Congratulations on your tremendous finish in the challenge! Best wishes to you both.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Unfortunately I didn''t get the time to come back to this and comment before end of voting. However, I did score this an 8. It''s beautiful. I can easily see the amount of time and effort you''ve put into it and IMHO, has paid off for you. What I find hard to understand are the dnmcs. In light of the comments, I''d have to say that those folk probably didn''t spend a heck of a lot of time looking at this image. A quick glance most likely gave an impression of party decorations, and so, they were unable to reconcile the arrangement with actual stationery...? Who knows. I''m just thinking out loud here anyway :) Both yours and Tim''s work are truly inspiring. Congratulations on your tremendous finish in the challenge! Best wishes to you both. ', '2006-07-12 08:47:46.000000', NULL, 0),
