(2619444, 356758, 57229, '<td valign="top">Thanks, Achoo - thanks Post - thanks everyone who left comments. <br/> <br/>Sorry about the lack of comment from my side, dr A, I realised it only too late to help you out.<br/> <br/>''Ghost Writer'' would probably have been enough for the title. It might have been an idea to leave the jacket open in order to demonstrate that there''s no one in it.<br/> <br/>I think I had a ''Pirates of the Carribean'' thing going through my head when I was shooting. Should have made a hook for the other hand...</td>', 'Thanks, Achoo - thanks Post - thanks everyone who left comments.  Sorry about the lack of comment from my side, dr A, I realised it only too late to help you out. ''Ghost Writer'' would probably have been enough for the title. It might have been an idea to leave the jacket open in order to demonstrate that there''s no one in it. I think I had a ''Pirates of the Carribean'' thing going through my head when I was shooting. Should have made a hook for the other hand...', '2006-07-13 16:39:04.000000', NULL, 0),
