(2626097, 354970, 37858, '<td valign="top">Trading Post Comment<br/> <br/>Congratulations (obviously) on your ribbon and 7+ score.  What I especially like about this abstract photo is the negative space and the subtle color shift of the blue areas as you move out of the center (darker) to the edges (lighter).  I also like the "fun" aspect of this photo...it''s almost like looking at a maze (except there is no way out).  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but since I like abstracts I would have been right up there with the concensus of the voters.  Well done.</td>', 'Trading Post Comment Congratulations (obviously) on your ribbon and 7+ score.  What I especially like about this abstract photo is the negative space and the subtle color shift of the blue areas as you move out of the center (darker) to the edges (lighter).  I also like the "fun" aspect of this photo...it''s almost like looking at a maze (except there is no way out).  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but since I like abstracts I would have been right up there with the concensus of the voters.  Well done.', '2006-07-16 02:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2627551, 357646, 58930, '<td valign="top">this is a really cool pic. How in gods name did you have the engergy to write all those notes... man... really did a good shot there! nice. congratulations</td>', 'this is a really cool pic. How in gods name did you have the engergy to write all those notes... man... really did a good shot there! nice. congratulations', '2006-07-16 19:09:34.000000', NULL, 0),
