(2636076, 358319, 57400, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smurman:</b></div><hr/><i> a little too straightforward. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think you aptly summed up my entire life!!! : )<br/>No complaints though; I''m finding it amazing what one can learn from photography.</td>', 'Originally posted by smurman: a little too straightforward.   I think you aptly summed up my entire life!!! : )No complaints though; I''m finding it amazing what one can learn from photography.', '2006-07-19 04:46:01.000000', NULL, 0),
